sequenceDiagram
    participant WF as Workflow Service
    participant Pay as Payment Service
    participant NACH as NACH Provider
    participant Bank as Bank System (Mocked)
    participant DB as Payment DB
    participant Kafka as Event Bus

    WF->>Pay: Initiate disbursement
    Pay->>NACH: Verify NACH mandate
    NACH-->>Pay: Mandate confirmed
    Pay->>Bank: Transfer funds (mocked)
    Bank-->>Pay: Transfer success
    Pay->>DB: Persist disbursement status
    DB-->>Pay: Commit success
    Pay->>Kafka: Publish LOAN_DISBURSED
    Kafka-->>WF: Event consumed
    WF-->>WF: Mark loan DISBURSED
